            "value": "<p>You take hold of one enemy and step off the edge of the world with it.</p><p>The target must attempt a Will save. On a failure, you and the target are both transported to the edge of the underworld for 1 minute. Nothing can follow you there and nothing can reach you from outside.</p><p>When the duration ends you both return to the spaces you left. If the target is dead when the duration ends, only you return.</p>"
